<title>south africa: CRICKET-ZIMBABWE SET 171 TO WIN IN 34 OVERS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ZIMBABWE SET 171 TO WIN IN 34 OVERS.</headline>
<dateline>PRETORIA 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe have been set 171 in 34 overs to beat India in the rain-interruped day/night 50 overs match at Centurion Park. India made 216 all out in 48.4 overs, but rain prevented the Zimbabwe reply beginning on time. The match eventually resumed at 1850GMT.</p>
</text>
